{%- doc -%}
  Eagle & Ash homepage (draft, 27 Oct 2026): "Why it's different" in three short points and a link to the About page.
  Facts: brand story facts given by Anu on 23 Oct 2026 (own design detail, small batches, makers in Istanbul, Riga and
  Tartu visited, own gift box; heading not "not plastic wrap": bath bombs are sealed in wrap, tees come in a resealable bag) and the facts sheet "1_Product facts & badges".
  30 Oct 2026 (Anu, Yvelin): point 02 shorter, cities only, and "Specialist makers" instead of "Makers we have met" (a visit
  alone is a weak signal; Anu: "we collaborate closely"); point 03 titled "Thoughtful down to the packaging". Only the trophy,
  the pouches and the bath bombs are named in 02, so it says "most of our gifts" (the tees are made in China).
  Numbers 01-03 use the heading and number style of the product pages ("Why it's different", blocks/product-story).

  @param {string} title - Heading; words between two stars are shown in orange.
  @param {string} link_label - Text of the link under the points.
  @param {string} link_url - Where the link goes.
{%- enddoc -%}
<div class="ea-home-why-band">
{%- render 'ea-eagle-mark', class: 'ea-home-why__eagle' -%}
<div class="ea-home-why">
  <h2 class="ea-home-why__title">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: title -%}</h2>
  <ol class="ea-home-why__list" role="list">
    <li class="ea-home-why__item">
      <h3 class="ea-story__heading ea-home-why__heading">
        <span class="ea-story__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <span class="ea-story__heading-text">Our own designs</span>
      </h3>
      <p>Every gift has a detail designed only for Eagle &amp; Ash, and each one is made in small batches.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="ea-home-why__item">
      <h3 class="ea-story__heading ea-home-why__heading">
        <span class="ea-story__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <span class="ea-story__heading-text">Specialist makers</span>
      </h3>
      <p>Small, specialized workshops make most of our gifts: the trophy in Tartu, the leather pouches in Istanbul, the bath bombs in Riga.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="ea-home-why__item">
      <h3 class="ea-story__heading ea-home-why__heading">
        <span class="ea-story__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <span class="ea-story__heading-text">Thoughtful down to the packaging</span>
      </h3>
      <p>We dislike gifts that arrive in plastic with a sticker. So most of our gifts come in their own box, ready to give.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  {%- if link_label != blank -%}
    <p class="ea-home-why__link"><a href="{{ link_url }}">{{ link_label | escape }}</a></p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* The eagle mark large and pale behind the points, off centre and cut off by the edges, as in the A+ images
     (Anu, 28 Oct 2026). #edf6f8 keeps the orange numbers and heading word at 3:1 contrast where it passes behind them. */
  .ea-home-why-band {
    position: relative;
    overflow-x: clip; /* cut off at the screen sides; upwards it may reach into the section above */
    overflow-y: visible;
  }

  /* The section above (the buyer-type cards) keeps its cards and texts in front of the eagle's wings */
  .section-collection-cards:has(+ .shopify-section .ea-home-why-band) .collection-cards > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Anu, 28 Oct 2026: as in the A+ images, the whole middle of the mark shows (the point at the bottom edge, the dip
     between the wings near the top) and the wings run out of the section; the point sits right of centre.
     Anu, 29 Oct 2026 (round 21): the curve between the wings (above the head) touches the bottom edge of the blue section
     above at every screen width, as at about 1100 px where she liked it. So the mark's size follows this band's height:
     in the mark's drawing the dip is 7.668 of 14.9545 units from the top, so a height of 14.9545 / 7.2865 x the band
     puts the dip on the band's top edge and the point on its bottom edge. The point is at 49.37 % of the mark's width. */
  .ea-home-why__eagle {
    position: absolute;
    left: 65%;
    bottom: 0;
    height: calc(100% * 14.9545 / 7.2865);
    width: auto;
    max-width: none; /* the theme keeps images and SVGs inside the screen width; this one is meant to be cut off */
    aspect-ratio: 42.4542 / 14.9545;
    translate: -49.37% 0;
    color: #edf6f8;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* phones: the band is tall (the points stacked), so the mark keeps a fixed size; its dip still touches the blue
     section: 1200 px wide = 422.7 px high, the dip 216.7 px below its top */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ea-home-why__eagle {
      left: 60%;
      top: -217px;
      bottom: auto;
      width: 1200px;
      height: auto;
    }
  }

  .ea-home-why {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 16px;
  }

  /* one heading size for all homepage sections, as "Who are you buying for?" (Anu, 28 Oct 2026) */
  .ea-home-why__title {
    margin: 0 0 36px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.3;

    @media screen and (max-width: 1200px) {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 990px) {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }

  .ea-home-why__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 28px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }


  .ea-home-why__item p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* number and subtitle on one text line (same baseline; centring lifted the subtitle about 3 px), subtitle a clear
     step above the 16 px text (was 18 px); the number keeps the product-page size (Anu, 28 Oct 2026) */
  .ea-home-why__heading.ea-story__heading {
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-block-end: 16px;
  }

  .ea-home-why__item p {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ea-home-why__heading .ea-story__number {
    font-size: 28.8px;
  }

  .ea-home-why__heading .ea-story__heading-text {
    font-size: 21px;
  }

  .ea-home-why__link {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ea-home-why__link a {
    color: #b83a00;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    /* round 21 (Anu: the heading is still a little too close to the section above): 96 px above it (was 72) */
    .ea-home-why {
      padding: 96px 16px 72px;
    }

    /* more room under the heading (Anu, 28 Oct 2026: it felt crowded) */
    .ea-home-why__title {
      margin-block-end: 52px;
    }

    /* the three texts start on one line even when a title takes two lines (30 Oct 2026: "Thoughtful down to the
       packaging" wraps): each point shares the list's two rows (title, text) */
    .ea-home-why__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: auto auto;
      gap: 0 40px;
    }

    .ea-home-why__item {
      display: grid;
      grid-row: span 2;
      grid-template-rows: subgrid;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
